{"path":"locale/collate_byname","title":"std::collate_byname","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>collate_byname","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/collate_byname","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"std::collate_byname is a std::collate facet which encapsulates locale-specific collation (comparison) and hashing of strings.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> collate_byname <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"kw1\">public</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\"><span class=\"kw1960\">std::<span class=\"me2\">collate</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>std::collate_byname</code> is a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\">std::collate</a></span> facet which encapsulates locale-specific collation (comparison) and hashing of strings. Just like <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\">std::collate</a></span>, it can be imbued in <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/basic_regex\">std::regex</a></span> and applied, by means of <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/operator()\"><code>std::locale::operator()</code></a>, directly to all standard algorithms that expect a string comparison predicate.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Specializations\">Specializations</h3>\n<p>The standard library is guaranteed to provide the following specializations:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">collate_byname</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td>\n<td> locale-specific collation of multibyte strings\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">collate_byname</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">wchar_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td>\n<td> locale-specific collation of wide strings\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><strong class=\"selflink\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></strong></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a new <code>collate_byname</code> facet <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><strong class=\"selflink\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></strong></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destroys a <code>collate_byname</code> facet <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::collate_byname::collate_byname\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::collate_byname::</span>collate_byname</h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> collate_byname<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> name, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> refs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> collate_byname<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> name, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> refs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a new <code>std::collate_byname</code> facet for a locale with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">name</span></code>. \n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">refs</span></code> is used for resource management: if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">refs <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>, the implementation destroys the facet, when the last <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">std::locale</a></span> object holding it is destroyed. Otherwise, the object is not destroyed.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> name\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the name of the locale\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> refs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the number of references that link to the facet\n</td></tr></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::collate_byname::.7Ecollate_byname\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::collate_byname::</span>~collate_byname </h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br>~collate_byname<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Destroys the facet.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-inherited\">\n<h2 id=\"Inherited_from_std::collate\">Inherited from <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>collate</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Nested_types\">Nested types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>char_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>CharT</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>string_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Data_members\">Data members</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member\n</td>\n<td> Description\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"t-dsc-small\"><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/id\">std::locale::id</a></span></span> <code>id</code> <span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span>\n</td>\n<td> the identifier of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet#Facet_class\">facet</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions_2\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate/compare\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>compare</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_compare</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::collate&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate/transform\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>transform</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_transform</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::collate&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate/hash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>hash</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_hash</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::collate&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Protected_member_functions\">Protected member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate/compare\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_compare</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two strings using this facet's collation rules <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::collate&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate/transform\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_transform</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  transforms a string so that collation can be replaced by comparison <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::collate&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate/hash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_hash</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  generates an integer hash value using this facet's collation rules <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::collate&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Collation order is the dictionary order: the position of the letter in the national alphabet (its <i>equivalence class</i>) has higher priority than its case or variant. Within an equivalence class, lowercase characters collate before their uppercase equivalents and locale-specific order may apply to the characters with diacritics. In some locales, groups of characters compare as single <i>collation units</i>. For example, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"ch\"</span></span></code> in Czech follows <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"h\"</span></span></code> and precedes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"i\"</span></span></code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"dzs\"</span></span></code> in Hungarian follows <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"dz\"</span></span></code> and precedes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"g\"</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>collate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  defines lexicographical comparison and hashing of strings <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strcoll\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>strcoll</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two strings in accordance to the current locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wcscoll\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wcscoll</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two wide strings in accordance to the current locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  lexicographically compares two strings using this locale's collate facet <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::locale</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Specializations","id":"Specializations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":2,"text":"std::collate_byname::collate_byname","id":"std::collate_byname::collate_byname"},{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":2,"text":"std::collate_byname::~collate_byname","id":"std::collate_byname::.7Ecollate_byname"},{"depth":2,"text":"Inherited from std::collate","id":"Inherited_from_std::collate"},{"depth":3,"text":"Nested types","id":"Nested_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Data members","id":"Data_members"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions_2"},{"depth":3,"text":"Protected member functions","id":"Protected_member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::collate_byname","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. std::collate_byname is a std::collate facet which encapsulates locale-specific collation (comparison) and hashing of…"},{"label":"Specializations","note":"The standard library is guaranteed to provide the following specializations:","children":[{"label":"std::collate_byname<char>","note":"locale-specific collation of multibyte strings"},{"label":"std::collate_byname<wchar_t>","note":"locale-specific collation of wide strings"}]},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a new collate_byname facet"},{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destroys a collate_byname facet"}]},{"label":"std::collate_byname::collate_byname","note":"Constructs a new std::collate_byname facet for a locale with name.","children":[{"label":"Parameters","note":"name, refs"}]},{"label":"std::collate_byname::~collate_byname","note":"Destroys the facet."},{"label":"Inherited from std::collate","children":[{"label":"Nested types"},{"label":"Data members"},{"label":"Member functions"},{"label":"Protected member functions"},{"label":"Notes","note":"Collation order is the dictionary order: the position of the letter in the national alphabet (its equivalence class) has higher priority than its case or…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":422,"codeBlockCount":0}
